  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in the bottom of a large clay tagine or Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add chicken and cook until browned on all sides, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "Add aromatic spices, honey, ginger, and chicken broth. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes or until chicken is cooked through.",
    "Stir in parsley, if using.",
